# Self-contained sub-apps under /projects/apps/. Each owns its whole
# document (own <head>, fonts, tokens, stylesheets) and shares no code
# with the site or with each other — see _config.yml's `layout: null`
# scope for the same rule enforced at build time. Design-system
# enforcement (tokens, CLAUDE.md directives, primitive reuse) does not
# apply inside this path.
projects/apps/**
